# CODEOWNERS — Require review for security-sensitive files
#
# GitHub evaluates CODEOWNERS top-to-bottom; last matching pattern wins.
# See: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# CI/CD pipeline files — changes to workflows, Dependabot, or pre-commit
# require review from a maintainer with security context.
.github/workflows/     @geekatron
.github/dependabot.yml @geekatron
.github/CODEOWNERS     @geekatron
.pre-commit-config.yaml @geekatron

# Governance and rule files — changes to framework constraints
.context/rules/        @geekatron
docs/governance/       @geekatron
